<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay prices down 0.5 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Paraguay prices down 0.5 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan prices fell 0.5 percent in July after rising 0.8 percent the previous month, the central bank said Thursday.</p>
<p>Accumulated inflation during 1997 now stands at 5.5 percent, down from 6.8 percent in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>Inflation over the past 12 months was 6.9 percent, down from 7,6 percent in the 12 months to the end of July 1996.</p>
<p>((-Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8))</p>
